==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gem-pro|*smakkijaną|t=to taste}}, from *{{inh|de|gem-pro|*smakkuz|t=a taste}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*smegʰ-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*smeg-|t=to taste}}. Compare English {{m|en|smack}} and {{m|en|smatch}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈʃmɛkn̩]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-schmecken.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|ɛkn̩|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|schmeckt|schmeckte|geschmeckt}}

# to [[taste]]
#: ''Das Bier '''schmeckt''' sehr gut.''
